@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+'@radix-ui/react-slot': patch
+---
+
+Fixed `Maximum update depth exceeded` infinite loop on React 19 when a `Slot` composes a callback ref that triggers a state update. `Slot` previously called `composeRefs` inline during render, creating a new ref function on every render; React 19 tears down and re-attaches a callback ref whenever its identity changes, so a state-setting ref caused an unbounded re-render loop. `Slot` now composes its ref through `useComposedRefs`, which returns a stable callback when the composed refs are stable.
